h model for 100 epochs with a batch size of 32.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s3","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"The learning rate was set to 0.001 with the Adam optimizer.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s4","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"Figure 1 shows the accuracy during training.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":null},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s5","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"As shown in Figure 1, By epoch 45, the accuracy of ResNet-50 stands at 87.8%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s6","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"Epoch 20 sees MobileNet post a accuracy of 76.2%.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s7","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"VGG-16 attains a accuracy of 42.4% at epoch 5.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s8","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"MobileNet beats ResNet-50 by about 19 points at epoch 45.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s9","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"Figure 2 shows the f1 score by dataset.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig1"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s10","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"As shown in Figure 2, on MNIST, BERT-base leads ResNet-18 by 4.1 points.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s11","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"On SVHN, Transformer leads ResNet-18 by 5.9 points.","page":0,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s12","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"Figure 3 shows the accuracy of ResNet-18 by dataset.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig2"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s13","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"ResNet-18 is 3.1 points higher on CIFAR-10 than on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s14","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"As shown in Figure 3, on CIFAR-10, ResNet-18 obtains a accuracy of 77.1%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s15","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"As shown in Figure 3, ResNet-18 reaches 14.0% accuracy on SVHN.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s16","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"On SVHN, XGBoost obtains an accuracy of 53.9%.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"},{"sentence_id":"phrasing_009_s17","report_id":"phrasing_009","text":"Overall, the results are in line with what we expected from the literature.","page":1,"nearest_figure_id":"fig3"}]}